@base = http://localhost:3011/api
@raffle = demo-rifa
@order = REEMPLAZAR_ID_COMPRA
@receipt = REEMPLAZAR_ID_COMPROBANTE

### Salud y configuración pública
GET {{base}}/health

### Catálogo
GET {{base}}/raffles

### Disponibilidad: no entrega propietarios
GET {{base}}/raffles/{{raffle}}/availability

### Login de la cuenta local; REST Client lee variables de backend/.env
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"{{$dotenv ADMIN_USERNAME}}","password":"{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Sesión
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reservar: ejecutar sólo en rifa de prueba
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"raffleId":"{{raffle}}","numbers":[21,22]}

### Mis compras
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transferencia; 503 hasta configurar datos de destino
POST {{base}}/orders/{{order}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout; 503 hasta configurar proveedor y URL HTTPS
POST {{base}}/orders/{{order}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conciliar estado con proveedor
POST {{base}}/orders/{{order}}/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revisar transferencia después de verificar acreditación real
POST {{base}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approve","note":"Acreditación verificada por el administrador."}

### Descargar archivo privado
GET {{base}}/receipts/{{receipt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 selección inválida
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"raffleId":"{{raffle}}","numbers":[0,1.5,1,1]}

### 401 sin sesión
GET {{base}}/admin/raffles

### 403: usar token de participante para endpoint administrativo
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_PARTICIPANTE

### 404 inexistente
GET {{base}}/raffles/no-existe

### 409: repetir un número ya reservado
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"raffleId":"{{raffle}}","numbers":[21]}

### 401 webhook sin firma
POST {{base}}/payments/webhook?data.id=123
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"payment","data":{"id":"123"}}
